Subject: [PATCH 2/4] feat(web): message-push config page with per-channel save
 + test

Adds /Configurations/PushConfig rendering all 10 Ray.Serilog push channels with
per-channel save (SQLite overlay + hot Reload, no restart) and a one-channel
test push built from an isolated temporary Serilog pipeline.
